Prominent modifications made in 2026 include, but are not limited to:

- the CTGTRec continuous-time graph and item-trend-aware model;
- strict per-user chronological preprocessing;
- continuous-time weighted graph construction;
- weighted temporal edge dropout;
- fixed three-seed validation/test evaluation protocol;
- dataset-specific final configurations;
- additional model adapters, reproducibility checks, and documentation;
- repository-root-independent configuration and command-line execution.

